Description: XLibre X server -- VMMouse input driver to use with VMWare
 This package provides the driver for the X11 vmmouse input device.
 .
 The VMMouse driver enables support for the special VMMouse protocol
 that is provided by VMware virtual machines to give absolute pointer
 positioning.
 .
 More information about XLibre can be found at:
 <URL:https://www.github.com/X11Libre/xserver>
 .
 This package is built from the XLibre xf86-input-vmmouse driver module.
Conflicts:
